    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTENT WARNING: CONTAINS IMAGES OF LARGE SPIDERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our protagonist has awakened in what it seems to be a hospital, and cannot remember anything that happened the day before. He needs to find a way out by discovering what it's lurking in the shadows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Detailed Description of Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles to unlock key equipment to escape the hospital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a hospital environment by unlocking doors and finding secret passageways.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you find the handgun, use it to defend yourself against the giant arachnids.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The primary enemies of the game are spiders and is not suitable for people with severe arachnophobia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no explicit references to sex, violence, or drugs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains jump scares.</p>",
